      "ro": "phûu yài phùuk khɔ̂ɔ mʉʉ hâi khûu bàao sǎao dûuai dâai khǎao",
      "ja": "年長者が新郎新婦の手首に白い糸を結びます。",
      "en": "The elders tie white string around the bride and groom's wrists.",
      "origin": "authored"
